flowchart TD
    Start((start)) -->|"fb2::Fiber / MakeWorkerFiberImpl"| Created["Created"]
    Created -->|"Start(Launch::post)"| Ready["Ready"]
    Created -->|"Start(Launch::dispatch)"| Running["Running"]
    Ready -->|"Scheduler::Run → SwitchTo"| Running
    Running -->|"ThisFiber::Yield"| Ready
    Running -->|"FiberCall::Get / PendingReq::Suspend"| WaitingIO["WaitingIO"]
    Running -->|"SleepFor / WaitUntil"| Sleeping["Sleeping"]
    Running -->|"EventCount / Mutex / Barrier / Join"| WaitingSync["WaitingSync"]
    WaitingIO -->|"CQE / epoll callback → Activate"| Ready
    Sleeping -->|"ProcessSleep 到期"| Ready
    WaitingSync -->|"notify / counter=0 / joined fiber ends"| Ready
    Running -->|"fiber function returns"| Terminating["Terminating"]
    Terminating -->|"ScheduleTermination + DestroyTerminated"| Reclaimed["Reclaimed"]
    Reclaimed --> Stop((end))
